source_6 = "record 22.30.141 [doc.10] (stale): Lines 39-51,107,198-200 and 221 retain a router, unified /rpc routes and receipt-authority service. The site and wiki also disagree on the advertised method count (15 versus 18); both need regeneration from the current gateway contract."
